      "evidence_ids": ["EP_0002_E01"],
      "explanation": "The claim states operating income increased by 17.45%. Calculating from the cited facts: (128,528 - 109,433) / 109,433 * 100 = 17.4490...%, which rounds to 17.45% (two decimal places). This matches the claim value. The filing's summary table reports a rounded whole percentage of 17%. The claim's calculated precision is correct per instructions.",
